  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chaco Santafesino Sustainable Water Security Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fundacin para el Desarrollo en Justicia y Paz (FUNDAPAZ), in conjunction with Unin de Organizaciones de Pequeos Productores de la Cuna Boscosa y los Bajos Sub-meridionales (UOCB), an association of base groups will improve access to water in 21 communities in the department of Vera, Santa Fe, by building mini reservoirs, retention basins, storage tanks and windmills and by training 785 families to maintain them.</narrative>
  </description>
